codex-run-13.log:32:2. Bag flight trail and a board-hit puff (review items #4 and #10).
codex-run-13.log:33:   - While a bag is flying, show 2–3 short fading afterimages of the bag, or a small pixel dust trail. Keep it subtle and cheap: no per-frame allocations, reuse pooled meshes.
codex-run-13.log:34:   - When a bag lands on the board and scores (ON THE BOARD), play a small puff using burst() with about 12–15 plain pieces at the landing spot. Keep the big confetti for in-the-hole only.
codex-run-13.log:35:Don't change anything else: no new buttons, camera static, wording "On the Board" and "Round", keep all batch 9–12 behavior. Use short test timeouts. Save screenshots to shots/task13-*.png, including a mid-flight shot and a phone text shot. Don't write to .git. Write a summary to codex-summary-13.md.
